      "en": "What am I saying then? That a thing sacrificed to idols is anything, or that an idol is anything?",
      "ko": "그런즉 내가 무엇을 말하느뇨 우상의 제물은 무엇이며 우상은 무엇이라 하느뇨",
      "source_text_hash": "1af86384adc524a6dc49085113b2d2caaac1065275a6b075965e89cf50a0fd2a",
      "translation_text_hash": "15cb72ca2b9c0bf258632fe2014eec92d8698bd06ffeb1a32a7dd375676a3527",
