      "en": "But if anyone says to you, “This was offered to idols,” don’t eat it for the sake of the one who told you, and for the sake of conscience. For “the earth is the Lord’s, with all its fullness.”",
      "ko": "누가 너희에게 이것이 제물이라 말하거든 알게 한 자와 및 양심을 위하여 먹지 말라",
      "source_text_hash": "cfe3b34fd8f0fba0a191207cb2096c3dc1cc2441b63b600b479b70203b0d344f",
      "translation_text_hash": "ea9208249e3d9840d789fedc662e86c2732de5e37dc4014efc1d2669da128d14",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "누가 너희에게 이것이 제물이라 말하거든 알게 한 자와 및 양심을 위하여 먹지 말라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "ea9208249e3d9840d789fedc662e86c2732de5e37dc4014efc1d2669da128d14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:1CO:10:29",
      "sequence": 28593,
      "chapter_label": "1CO 10",
      "verse_label": "29",
      "locator": {
